  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray",
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "2 teaspoons baking soda",
    "1/2 teaspoon kosher salt",
    "2 large eggs",
    "1 (20 ounce) can crushed pineapple with juice",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese",
    "0.5 cup unsalted butter, softened",
    "1.5 cups confectioners' sugar",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-baking dish with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/MlmODOxHqpPBhKeU_mZjqI7nr78=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15857-Easy-Pineapple-Cake-DDMFS-Step-01-1ee1615b199444a2b51dd14c10f02d45.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15857/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix flour, white sugar, baking soda, and salt in a large bowl and make a well in the center.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HuzLtH6Bq9wscjahPzsFAK-kgMk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15857-Easy-Pineapple-Cake-DDMFS-Step-02-f538741129b04daba7ba732858c6ae5f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15857/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add eggs, crushed pineapple with juice, and vanilla; whisk until well-combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0LC18uc7zkdeJfVvRRaOcBzV38I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15857-Easy-Pineapple-Cake-DDMFS-Step-03-d2978c14771f455b82f7ec2072b40586.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15857/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour into the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9Wm9oWsPCHJv07MZ51Sq3asIeik=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15857-Easy-Pineapple-Cake-DDMFS-Step-04-8c7904aee5fe429c986b2d6eb5172f3f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15857/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until top is deeply browned and a toothpick inserted into the center of the cake comes out clean, about 35 minutes. Let cake cool in the dish on a wire rack, 1 to 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bD68Md1jkaSw5zfs1sB95dtGuso=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15857-Easy-Pineapple-Cake-DDMFS-Step-05-3602d4fd837a4c0b9e7a7ce5be4fb993.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15857/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the frosting: Combine cream cheese and butter for frosting in a mixing bowl; beat with an electric mixer until smooth, about 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/n78rATCiBK02TqiGUcNt5t3QcTc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15857-Easy-Pineapple-Cake-DDMFS-Step-06-5bb5e7bbbac740b8bfca8ad96f941ffb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15857/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add confectioners' sugar and vanilla; beat until creamy, about 1 or 2 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ybr4izjPxWqW2SNPNk6iSX6-zts=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15857-Easy-Pineapple-Cake-DDMFS-Step-07-d1c7839f07854650896ed52e503e9bfe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15857/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread frosting on cooled cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-WmElHwcU2FElMIgab3zNovmgjI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15857-Easy-Pineapple-Cake-DDMFS-Step-08-e54328f6432f4f66b0c1e9e6895c7fb9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15857/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GHJl1NqVoa7UhT7RCVwCEPMnc94=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15857-Easy-Pineapple-Cake-DDMFS-4x3-6127575ad6c941a28038561637003450.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15857/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
